# 読み取り専用（source-of-truth / assets）

- Never edit, delete, rename, or move any file under `docs/source-of-truth/`.
- Never edit, delete, rename, or move any file under `assets/` (配布資産。生成・改変禁止)。
- Never edit files whose frontmatter has `ai.editable: false` or `ai_editable: false`.
- Reading and citing them is allowed and encouraged.
- If a change seems necessary, open or update a GitHub Issue for a human; do not modify the files yourself.
